---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Chapel — Don't Lose Your Way" description="A creative space where visitors can write a few words about what they are feeling and transform those emotions into phrases, lyrics, or songs. The Chapel returns soon.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>The Chapel</h1>
      <p>A creative space where visitors can write a few words about what they are feeling and transform those emotions into phrases, lyrics, or songs.</p>
      <p>Through the Chapel experience, feelings can be transformed into words, phrases, lyrics, or songs that give emotion a voice.</p>
      <p class="returns"><strong>The Chapel returns soon.</strong></p>
      <p>It is being rebuilt with care — the same quiet room, on a foundation that can keep it safe. Until it opens again, the rest of this space is here: <a href="/journal">read a reflection</a>, <a href="/podcast">listen to a voice that knows</a>, or <a href="/resources">find a grounding tool for tonight</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .returns { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text); margin-top: 2rem; }
  </style>
</Layout>
